lib/matter-controller.js follows the matter.js controller calls of, and the
run learning in lib/engine.js (learned finish wait, rejoining split runs,
running level and standby) is based on ideas from, homebridge-appliance-monitor
by Oliver Rummeyer (MIT licence), https://github.com/rummeyer/homebridge-appliance-monitor
